window.products.push({"id":362010,"name":"GABRYLLY Ergonomic Office Chair, High Back Mesh Home Desk Chair with Lumbar Support and Flip-up Arms, Adjustable Headrest & Comfortable Seat, Tilt Fun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-UDoTKFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ergonomic Support】It's an upgraded version of GABRYLLY ergonomic office chair that has a HIGHER BACKREST to improve back and lumbar support. Friendly to tall users (5'5\"and 6'3\"). The backrest can be set to three positions for maximum comfort, including 90° for sitting, 110° for leaning, and 120° for relaxing. You can get personalized comfort, including an higher backrest, flip-up arms, and customizable headrest. 【Space-saving Design】The flip-up arms on this mesh chair can be easily folded up 45°, saving valuable floor space. The armrests are also adjustable the height 1.8 in, with a soft PU surface for comfortable elbow support. Chair size : 25.2x22.8x50.79-54.53 in(WxDxH), seat size: 20x18.7 in(WxD), Backrest size: 18.3x21.3 in(WxH) 【Upgraded & Larger Seat】A wider, curved mesh seat offers increased comfort, with a design that helps prevent discomfort in the back of the thigh. The home desk chair is capable of supporting users up to 300 lbs, with a breathable and durable mesh seat. 【Improved neck and head support】The adjustable headrest can be adjusted to 3 modes, including a 6-inch height adjustment and 45° angle alteration, reducing stress on the neck and head during long hours of work. 【Easy Installation & 5 Years Warranty】 With Allen wrench and guideline, it only needs 20-25 mins to finish the ergo chair installation. This durable computer chair comes with 5 years warranty & part replacement service. Contact our GABRYLLY support team to get quick solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-UDoTKFNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GABRYLLY","source_asin":"B0BXB96XYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362010","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXB96XYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXB96XYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
