window.products.push({"id":362172,"name":"Set of 6 Pysanky - Wooden Ukrainian Easter Eggs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KjOnrJ13L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fill your Easter basket with these colorful geometric design wooden Easter eggs. Hand carved and hand painted by skilled artists high in the Carpathian mountains, Western Ukraine. Historically, one of the most popular Easter gifts was hand painted real eggshell or wooden egg. Family members or friends gave them to each other, and a bowl of Easter eggs would also be set out in the house, to protect against misfortunes. Become part of the ancient tradition by sharing these colorful Easter gifts with your friends and family!  2.25 Inches Tall X 1.5 Inches in Diameter (Approx. Dimensions) 5.7 cm Tall X 3.8 cm Diameter (Approx. Dimensions) Pine Wood Hand Carved Hand Painted  High-gloss Varnish Applied  Made in Ukraine Wooden eggs are hand painted eggs that come in a variety of different themes. They can be found unfinished or with a variety of different designs. A wooden egg stand is also included. These eggs make a great addition to any collection. They are also a great gift for Easter, Christmas, or any other holiday. The hand painting on these eggs is very detailed and beautiful. The different themes of these eggs include: nature, animals, landscapes, religious, and more. There are also a variety of different sizes and shapes of these eggs. The unfinished wooden eggs are great for those who like to paint or carve their own designs. These eggs are also a great way to start a new collection. Wooden eggs are a unique and beautiful way to decorate your home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91KjOnrJ13L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BestPysanky","source_asin":"B07H78HZHY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H78HZHY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H78HZHY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
