window.products.push({"id":362286,"name":"True Bayberry Wax Votive - Hand Poured","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21GQ2CWSBZL._AC_.jpg","description":"It requires more than 1.5 quarts of bayberries to make just one 8\" taper candle! However, bayberry wax is not ideal in and of itself for candle burning. The flame is small and irregular due to the extreme density of the wax itself, and its high cost is prohibitive. It is a rare thing to find a true bayberry wax candle. Our chandler uses only the finest, purest bayberry wax (a 40% ratio) and blends it a proprietary blend of waxes to ensure a clean burn and a tall flame. We are proud to offer them to you here at Sacred Mists Shoppe! Kissed with their own natural fragrance (a whispered scent reminiscent of a breeze flowing through an evergreen-laden winter wonderland), these pure bayberry candles are perfect year-round as well bringing abundance into your daily life and the lives of those around you. Price shown is per votive. Long and clean burning with 100% cotton wick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21GQ2CWSBZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sacred Mists Shoppe","source_asin":"B000K6WCX2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000K6WCX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000K6WCX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
