window.products.push({"id":362427,"name":"Mfault I Am Always with You Cardinals Appear When Angels Are Near Quote Wall Art Set of 3, Red Bird Canvas Print Picture Birch Tree Branch Poster Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QkhmHOAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design Your Home Decor Styles with Our Exquisite Wall Decals Decorate your space with our wall mural which are easy to peel and stick. These wall decals are great for living room, bedroom, study room, playroom, nursery room and any smooth and clean surface. Hassle-free: By your hands, you can secure them into place according to your design layout and get the perfect display in an easy way. Quick and easy to apply: Just peel, then stick the wall decals and decorate your home into the most cozy and warm place with them! Wide application: These wall stickers can also be used as decorations for Easter, Independence Day, St. Patrick’s Day, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas, etc. Great gift idea for girls, boys, men and women to adorn their bedroom. A piece of pleasant wall sticker might motivate you to get through the day in a good mood. Use Instructions 1. Roll the decal oppositely to make it flat. 2. Make sure the surface to be pasted is smooth and clean. 3. Warm up the decal by using something like hair dryer. 4. Arrange the decal as shown or make a pattern of your own creativity. Applicable Types: Smooth wall, smooth wallpaper, glass surface, plastic surface, tile surface, wood surface, metallic surface. Unavailable Types: Rough surface, wet surface, dusty lime wall, 3d bump wallpaper. Suitable for: Men and women room decor, dorm decorations, birthday party decor, theme decorations and home decorations, etc. Wide Application: Smooth wall, windows, furniture, cars, doors, mirrors, lockers, luggage, tables, wardrobe, bookshelves, musical instrument surfaces, refrigerator, etc. How to Remove the Decals Just slowly peel from the wall and leave no sticky remains behind. Or heat the area that you are peeling off with a hair dryer to make it more removable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QkhmHOAeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mfault","source_asin":"B09MHC6N92","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHC6N92","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHC6N92","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
