window.products.push({"id":362438,"name":"100% Stainless Steel Wire Cooling Rack for Cooling and Baking fits Jelly Roll Pan - Oven Safe, Heavy Duty (10\" x 15”) - FREE Non-Stick Silicone Spatul","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J6i+P4edL._AC_SL1294_.jpg","description":"Have you been searching for the top quality rack which fits perfectly any 10¼\" x 15¼\" jelly roll pans and guarantees a real value for your money? Your search is finally over. We are very proud to offer an excellent, multi-purpose rack which is guaranteed to suit your needs. Best part - no more money spent on cheap quality racks. Unlike other racks that made out of cheap steel that easily bends and becomes rusty, our rack made out of top standard 304 18/8 100% stainless steel metal that will not bend, and will not rust. Moreover, no more mess - our wire rack features a tighter grid pattern so that it can hold big and heavy foods or cakes without them being sliced by the metal. Designed to make your time in the kitchen a pure pleasure. Being multi-functional, the 10\" x 15\" cooling rack fits perfectly any 10¼\" x 15¼\" jelly roll pans (also fits Nordic ware & Wilton pans). Enjoy our multi-purpose wire rack - grill meats, chicken and fish, roast vegetables, cool down cookies and enjoy a healthier meal with an amazing crispy flavor. All that, combined with an oven-safe, heat resistant to 575˚f stainless steel rack supported by 3 heavy duty, super strong cross bars, guarantees the best value for your money. You are getting a wire rack that will last for a lifetime! Free bonus is included - silicone heat resistant spatula. An absolutely complementary tool for a wire rack, use it for mixing, serving, folding, spreading, scraping and flipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J6i+P4edL._AC_SL1294_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoolingBake","source_asin":"B019ZVJ9GK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019ZVJ9GK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019ZVJ9GK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
