window.products.push({"id":362574,"name":"Denby USA Natural Canvas 4PC Placesetting","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614I6zqWmBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Natural canvas is hand-crafted at denby pottery from high quality, locally-sourced clay. The timeless, neutral tones and shape design of denby's natural canvas make it a range suited to any Home's style and Color and works equally well when mixed and matched with other items. The unique and rich denby glaze gives warmth as well as durability and makes every piece unique. This 4 piece set is ideal to cover all occasions from Tuesday teatime to Sunday lunch. It is a great gift for somebody just starting their denby collection. Contains: 1 x dinner plate, 1 x salad plate, 1 x cereal bowl, 1 x textured mug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614I6zqWmBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Denby","source_asin":"B06Y1NJ2H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362574","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y1NJ2H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y1NJ2H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":362575,"name":"WMF Manaos 97-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E9AA281NL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Perfect for entertaining and durable enough for everyday use, this WMF Manaos 97-piece flatware set is made of high quality Cromargan 18/10 stainless steel, so it won't rust or corrode. The Manaos pattern is a clean, contemporary European design polished to a bright mirror finish. The perfectly balanced hollow handle knife with an inserted blade allows WMF to offer the finest cutting edge and keep the knife comfortable in the hand. The unique entertaining set is quite generous with its components and covers all aspects of serving a multiple-course meal. This flatware is dishwasher-safe and never needs polishing. Amazon.com Exceptionally smooth and well-balanced, Manaos stainless-steel flatware from German home-product design firm WMF sets a sleekly contemporary table. Handles are long and slender with no ornamentation-just a hint of a bevel at the blunt end. The spoons feature large oval bowls, the forks four tines, and the knife blades a bow front that curves to a rounded point. Manaos is a creation of Peter Bäurle, a WMF flatware designer with a superlative aesthetic and approximately 40 flatware designs to his name. A dinner party for 12 can get underway right off the bat with this 103-piece Manaos set. Each of the twelve place settings contains not just the usual dinner knife and fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon, but also a compelling espresso spoon. In order to have sorbet or crème brûlée for dessert without washing after the main course, the set includes a dozen extra teaspoons and 6 iced beverage spoons. Coordinating serving utensils include two serving spoons with oversized, round bowls; a similarly rounded cleft serving fork; and a two-pronged pickle or meat fork, butter knife, cake knife, and triangular pie server. All are constructed of WMF's patented Cromargan 18/10 stainless steel, with 18 percent chrome providing the stainless property, and 10 percent nickel giving acid-resistance and beautiful luster. When the party is over, Manaos slips without worry into the dishwasher for cleaning. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 12 place settings, 12 extra teaspoons, 6 iced beverage spoons, and 7 serving utensils. Each place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon; espresso spoon. The serving utensils consist of: 2 serving spoons; serving fork; pickle fork; butter knife; pie server; cake knife. 103 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41E9AA281NL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WMF","source_asin":"B000F3V9WA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000F3V9WA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000F3V9WA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
