window.products.push({"id":362608,"name":"Bright Zeal 12 Inch Large Bronze LED Light Up Heart Marquee Heart with Lights and Timer - Lighted Heart Wall Decorations For Living Room - Outdoor Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J1i0BCgPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LOVE & BE LOVED WITH \"HEART\", DAY AND NIGHT, ON OR OFF 1. The 12.6\" tall 12.8\" wide 2\" thick textured PS marquee light is shaped as a captivating \"HEART\", so elegant both at night and by day, on or off.2. At night, 18 LED bulbs imbedded on the marquee surface light up \"HEART\" in romantic warm white glow, emitting adoration & affection.3. An inspirational way to light up your home or special events: engagements, weddings, anniversaries, birthdays for romantic ambience. \"HEART\" MARQUEE LIGHT FOR TABLE AND WALL 1. When on, the marquee HEART displays in warm white glow, bringing romance & warmth to any place.2. One keyhole slot at back for an easy wall decor.3. The classical color and the textured PS exterior match any event or decoration themes. 4. Perfect for special events, making a bold statement of your love with HEART to your loved ones and yourself. LET TIME BE YOUR CONVENIENCE 1. 6hr Timer: Once the light is switched on, the timer is triggered. 2. The light will stay on for 6 hours and remain off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically. ENERGY-SAVING & DURABLE 1. No power outlet needed & requires 2 AA batteries (included).2. 18 long lasting LED bulbs provide low energy consumption while enhancing your festival cheer & produce no heat after long-time use.3. Textured PS exterior: sturdy, lightweight, corrosion-resistant & durable. FAQs 1. It will always be in the OFF position when you receive your order, you will need to switch it to the ON position (at the back of the light) during installation.2. An ON/OFF switch is at back for manual control. ATTENTION 1. Store the light in a cool & dry place and remove batteries if product is not to be used for a long time.2. If hanging, please ensure the hook has some extra space for easier operation on the switch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J1i0BCgPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B017K1N2WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017K1N2WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017K1N2WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
