window.products.push({"id":362934,"name":"Peter Khanun Feather Pillow 3D Bread White Duck/Goose Down Feather Pillows for Sleeping,100% Cotton Standard Size 19\"x 29\" (Goose Down)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sYvLo-CEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Cotton Shell:covered with a top quality,233 thread count fabric,made of 100% Cotton,with down proof stitching,to leave down feathers away from poking out. Item Size:48 x 74 cm/18.90 x 29.13 Inches,Fill Weight:35 oz. Natural filling:Our pillow inserts are filled with 85% Goose feathers and 15% Goose down,Comfortable,Dry,Breathable,Good resilience,Resistance to extrusion,Long-term use without deformation.Perfect for anyone searching for a premium level of medium support for their neck and shoulders. Usage:1.When you take it out of the vacuum seal the first time,you can clap your pillow with your hand to make it quickly return to the original shape,and wait 30 minutes for better results.2.When the pillow appears concave,the same method as 1,give them 2-3 hours of sun bathing regularly, for healthier use. Customer Service:The home down pillows provide customers with better sleep quality,and no reason to return.If you have any questions on our products,please feel free to contact us by email,we will reply you ASAP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sYvLo-CEL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peter Khanun","source_asin":"B076Q6K134","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076Q6K134","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076Q6K134","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":362935,"name":"Personalized Dogs First Christmas Ornament 2022 - Polyresin Yellow Labrador Ornament - Cutest Yellow Lab Gifts for All Lab Lovers - Dog Ornaments for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812VphIlP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in matter of weeks. Our personalized sheepdog ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors, charm and realistic features of a playful mini Yellow Lab dog holding a heart on a Christmas wreath. Get ready for some serious puppy love this Christmas with our personalized Yellow Lab ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – unlike other personalized Christmas ornaments that often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every 2022 realistic Yellow Labrador dog ornaments for Christmas trees is hand painted to ensure your little Yellow Labrador dog is a one-of-a-kind furry friend you’ll cherish forever. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – add a charming keepsake to your holiday tree décor collection and cherish your family’s best furry friend. Give your dog a special place on the Christmas tree with these unique Christmas ornaments that are sure to bring smiles to your family’s face. Hand painted and crafted with festive lifelike details, vibrant colors, and customized to your exact specifications – your Labrador Christmas decorations 2022 will make your Christmas tree feel extra special. 24 Hour Order Processing – Custom personalized and ready for gifting or hanging on the tree with the attached ribbon. Your personalized dog Christmas gifts arrive nestled in tissue paper with a gift box, giftbag, and gift tag – no need for wrapping! Give the ideal dog gift of joy this Holiday season to the dog lover or pet parent – or as a memorial gift for remembrance of a beloved furry friend. Happy and Satisfied Dog Lovers - At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting Beautiful and Unique dog gifts for dog lovers and families to celebrate the Holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 custom tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your Yellow Labrador decorations, let us know and we’ll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812VphIlP9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08977F6H3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08977F6H3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08977F6H3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
