window.products.push({"id":362938,"name":"III Enstex Blackout Curtain Panels, Solid Thermal Insulated Room Darkening Grommet Top Drapes, Noise Reducing Energy Saving Light Blocking Drapes for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LIKZbCCWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Value Package: 2 panels of beige blackout curtains per package. Each panel measures 52x84 inches with 8 luxurious and elegant silver top grommets. Quality Material & Gorgeous Design: 220-230 GSM imported polyester material, thicker, softer, smooth touching, durable, no chemical odors. The silk soft fabric, aligned seams and hems, trimmed neatly edge, more suitable for realizing a dreamlike drape feeling. The stainless steel grommet with a diameter of 1.6 inches also allows you to slide freely and smoothly on standard curtain rods for vertical suspension, easy to install, ideal for farmhouse, bedroom, living room, kitchen, etc. True Blackout Drapes: The innovative triple weaving technology is applied in the fabric. The 3 layers including high density black yarn not only block 90-99% of the sunlight and UV rays (darker color works better), but also help to muffle the outside noise, and protect your privacy, perfect for baby naps, night shift workers, late sleepers, home decor, etc. Thermal Insulated: Our thermal drapes can balance the indoor temperature and cut down energy bills by insulating against summer heat and winter chill. Maintaining a comfortable ambient temperature in your room is conducive to energy conservation and the protection of upholstery and floor from color fading, perfect for bedroom, living room, kids room and nursery room. Easy Care: Hand or machine washable in gentle circulating cold water (below 86 F), quick ironing, steam clean, or tumble dry on low heat for long-term use, but do not bleach. Besides, although the wrinkles will fall out on their own over time, we recommend carefully using a steamer or dryer before hanging to remove some slight wrinkles caused by folding, further highlighting the beauty and improving your use experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LIKZbCCWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"III Enstex","source_asin":"B097JG3TWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-362938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097JG3TWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097JG3TWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
